+| maximumRecuperationPower          | float (≥ 0) | unlimited (W)    | Maximum mechanical braking power the motor can recover  |
+| maximumRecuperationTorque         | float (≥ 0) | unlimited (Nm)   | Maximum regenerative braking torque at the motor shaft   |
+| gearRatio                         | float (> 0) | 10               | Ratio of motor speed to wheel speed for the torque limit |
